# The leaf carries its own `[workspace]`, so it also carries its own
# target directory.
/target

# `wasm-bindgen --target web --out-dir pkg` output. Generated from
# `target/wasm32-unknown-unknown/release/net_leaf.wasm` by the build
# command in the Stage 5 report; the browser runner and
# `@net-mesh/browser`'s size script both build it rather than read a
# committed copy, so a stale bundle can never be what a witness ran
# against.
/pkg
